Security Operations / Web Security Remediation Project

This project demonstrates hands-on experience in external attack surface reduction, web security hardening, 
threat intelligence utilization, and security validation. 
Reviewed external risk assessments conducted using UpGuard and personally carried out all remediation and validation activities
to reduce the organization’s external attack surface. Remediation was performed from August 5 to September 5, 2025, resulting
in a confirmed improvement in external cyber risk rating from C to A.
